{"id":"A1-L025","title":"Present Simple × Continuous: introduction","cefr":"A1","level":"A1","unit":"A1-U02","focus":"Present Simple × Continuous — introdução","targets":{"grammar":"Present Simple × Continuous — introdução","pron":"do you (fala rápida)","verbs":["ride"],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["bike","ride","corner","empty","fast","laugh","wait","arrive"],"field":"Rotina","genre":"Conto e trecho de peça","skill":"Fala","words_min":8},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 25 · Present Simple × Continuous: introduction","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Present Simple × Continuous — introdução.","**Verbos:** ride.","**Pronúncia:** do you (fala rápida).","**8 palavras novas** (rotina).","**Texto do dia:** conto e trecho de peça."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A1):** eu consigo contrastar rotina (Simple) e ação agora (Continuous) em uma cena."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você ainda não faz as provas, mas já treina o formato de tarefas curtas que elas usam.","Esta aula treina **responder em frases completas (IELTS Speaking, TOEFL Speaking)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["bike","bicicleta"],["ride","andar (de bike)"],["corner","esquina"],["empty","vazio"],["fast","rápido"],["laugh","rir"],["wait","esperar"],["arrive","chegar"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A short story","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"The Bike Ride","paras":["Every morning, Nina **rides** her bike to school. Today she **is riding** very fast because she is late.","Nina usually **wakes up** at six, but today she **is sleeping** until seven. The street is empty. She **sees** her friend, and he **is waiting** at the corner.","“You **always arrive** early,” he says. “Not today!” she laughs."],"kicker":"SHORT STORY","by":"A reader","gloss":[["ride","andar de bicicleta"],["empty","vazio"],["corner","esquina"],["laugh","rir"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Nina rides her bike every morning.","ans":"T","why":"“Every morning.”"},{"q":"Today she is early.","ans":"F","why":"Está atrasada."},{"q":"Her friend is waiting.","ans":"T","why":"“is waiting at the corner.”"},{"q":"Nina lives far from school.","ans":"NG","why":"Não diz."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“empty” means…","opts":["vazio","cheio","pequeno"],"ans":0,"why":"empty = vazio."},{"q":"“corner” means…","opts":["esquina","parede","porta"],"ans":0,"why":"corner = esquina."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Present Simple × Present Continuous","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Simple","Continuous"],"rows":[["rotina: **She rides every day.**","agora: **She is riding now.**"],["fato: **The sun rises.**","temporário: **I am staying here this week.**"],["**usually, always, never**","**now, today, at the moment**"]],"cap":"Contraste"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Pergunta-chave","body":"É hábito? → **Simple**. É agora? → **Continuous**."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"She ___ to school every day. (ride)","a":"rides","why":"Rotina → Simple."},{"s":"Today she ___ fast. (ride)","a":"is riding","why":"Hoje → Continuous."},{"s":"He ___ at the corner now. (wait)","a":"is waiting","why":"Agora."},{"s":"I ___ coffee every morning. (drink)","a":"drink","why":"Rotina."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["bike","bicicleta"],["ride","andar (de bike)"],["corner","esquina"],["empty","vazio"],["fast","rápido"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["late","today","I'm"],"ans":"I'm late today","pt":"Estou atrasada hoje."},{"words":["up","at","six","Yes","I","wake"],"ans":"Yes I wake up at six","pt":"Sim, acordo às seis."}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"bike","pos":"noun","pt":"bicicleta","ex":"My bike is red.","expt":"Minha bicicleta é vermelha."},{"w":"ride","pos":"verb","pt":"andar (de bike)","ex":"I ride to school.","expt":"Vou de bike à escola."},{"w":"corner","pos":"noun","pt":"esquina","ex":"At the corner.","expt":"Na esquina."},{"w":"empty","pos":"adj","pt":"vazio","ex":"The street is empty.","expt":"A rua está vazia."},{"w":"fast","pos":"adv","pt":"rápido","ex":"Ride fast.","expt":"Ande rápido."},{"w":"laugh","pos":"verb","pt":"rir","ex":"She laughs.","expt":"Ela ri."},{"w":"wait","pos":"verb","pt":"esperar","ex":"I wait here.","expt":"Espero aqui."},{"w":"arrive","pos":"verb","pt":"chegar","ex":"I arrive early.","expt":"Chego cedo."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**Why are you riding so fast?** — Por que está pedalando tão rápido?","**I’m late today.** — Estou atrasada hoje.","**You usually arrive early.** — Você geralmente chega cedo."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"ride","pt":"andar de (bike, cavalo)","forms":[["I ride","I ride my bike."],["you ride","You ride well."],["he / she / it rides","She rides to school."],["we / they ride","We ride together."]],"note":"**ride** = andar em veículo sem motor ou montar; **drive** = dirigir."}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Running late","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Running late","lines":[["Friend","Why are you riding so fast?","Por que está pedalando tão rápido?"],["Nina","I’m late today.","Estou atrasada hoje."],["Friend","You usually arrive early.","Você geralmente chega cedo."],["Nina","Yes, I wake up at six.","Sim, acordo às seis."],["Friend","And today?","E hoje?"],["Nina","I’m sleeping until seven!","Estou dormindo até as sete!"]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: do you (fala rápida)","items":[{"label":"do you (fala rápida)","note":"Palavras com /r/: ride, arrive, corner, early. Língua curvada para trás.","words":["ride","arrive","corner","early"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Say what you do every day and what you are doing now.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I usually study at night. Today I’m studying now."},{"q":"Ask: Why are you…ing?","pt":"Pergunte.","model":"Why are you riding so fast?"},{"q":"Say what you always do.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I always arrive early."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write a 6-line story contrasting always and today.","model":"Nina always rides her bike. Today she is late. She is riding fast. Her friend is waiting. She usually arrives early. Not today!","checklist":["Usei **Simple** e **Continuous**","Usei **always / today**","Usei **-s**"],"words":"6 linhas"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “bike” mean?","opts":["bicicleta","andar (de bike)","vazio"],"ans":0,"why":"**bike** = bicicleta."},{"q":"What does “ride” mean?","opts":["esquina","andar (de bike)","rápido"],"ans":1,"why":"**ride** = andar (de bike)."},{"q":"What does “corner” mean?","opts":["vazio","rir","esquina"],"ans":2,"why":"**corner** = esquina."},{"q":"What does “empty” mean?","opts":["vazio","rápido","esperar"],"ans":0,"why":"**empty** = vazio."},{"q":"“She usually ___ early.”","opts":["arrives","is arriving","arrive"],"ans":0,"why":"usually → Simple."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["No **TOEFL Reading**, narrativas misturam tempos: marque os advérbios.","No **Writing**, escolha o tempo pelo advérbio."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Faça **cartões** com *every day* × *now*.","Use **mímicas** para o Continuous.","Erro típico: *“She rides now.”* → *She is riding now.*"]}]}]}